  "id": "336",
  "document": "静躁独行.txt",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "336:p0",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "$t1 == '336'?\r\n`",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:76703:76719"
    },
    {
      "id": "336:p1",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:76719:76721"
    },
    {
      "id": "336:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“亚历克斯，”他说。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:76721:76733"
    },
    {
      "id": "336:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你凝固了。“你怎么知道我的名字的？”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:76733:76753"
    },
    {
      "id": "336:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“幼子告知我。祂想要一个家庭，亚历克斯。我们可以给祂一个家。”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:76753:76786"
    },
    {
      "id": "336:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“雪花噪音里的声音？”你问。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:76786:76802"
    },
    {
      "id": "336:p6",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“幼子。是的。”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:76802:76812"
    },
    {
      "id": "336:p7",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你可能会多次回到这一条目。请选择你尚未选择过的选项。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:76812:76840"
    },
    {
      "id": "336:p8",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要问幼子是什么，转到 337。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:76840:76857"
    },
    {
      "id": "336:p9",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要追问幼子想要什么，转到 338。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:76857:76876"
    },
    {
      "id": "336:p10",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要问陌生人是如何得知这一切的，转到 339。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:76876:76900"
    },
    {
      "id": "336:p11",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要询问他是否就是你在附近见过的男子，转到 340。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:76900:76927"
    },
    {
      "id": "336:p12",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "当你要结束谈话时，选择以下的选项：\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:76927:76946"
    },
    {
      "id": "336:p13",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要对男人说他这是无稽之谈，转到 341。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:76946:76968"
    },
    {
      "id": "336:p14",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要问他你如何才能安全离开，转到 350。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:76968:76990"
    }
  ]
}
